<div class="dashboard-head reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">Platform reporting</span><h1>Reports & analytics</h1><p>Order, value, product, farmer, and market performance for a selected period.</p></div><button class="btn btn-light" type="button" onclick="window.print()"><?= icon('upload') ?> Print report</button></div>
